      "value": "I would actually prefer a distinction between playspace locomotion and analog stick locomotion. Having the local varient become the accepted varient would enable a lot of interesting things.\n\nBut having a different parameter between the two would be ideal.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
