      "value": "@{62def87167455d44a141e91e|full_name}: Just to note: velocity is broken for contact receivers/senders too, and so this might be a related bug: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/onenter-contact-receiver-velocity-behaves-incorrectly",
